1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
What did you do yesterday?
Hôm qua bạn đã làm gì?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
I went to the zoo.
Mình đã đi sở thú.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Oh, lucky you!
Ồ, bạn may mắn quá!

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Were there any parrots?
Có con vẹt nào không?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
No, there weren't.
Không, không có.

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Were there any meerkats?
Có con cầy meerkat nào không?

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Yes, there were.
Có, có đấy.

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Was there a dolphin show?
Có buổi biểu diễn cá heo không?

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Yes, there was.
Có, có đấy.

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Were there any gorillas?
Có con khỉ đột nào không?

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
No, there weren't.
Không, không có.

